'''Heavy Assault C.A.T''' (重機C・A・T Jūki C.A.T, '''Heavy Equipment C.A.T''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Heavy Assault C.A.T.
|image = E 132.png
|first appearance = [[Boxing Clever (Expert)]]
|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 25|Infernal Tower - Floor 25]]
|money drop = 1,950¢ - 7,702¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has very high health, attack power, and range, as well as an area attack, but it attacks quite slowly. However, it moves quite quickly, so be careful of it sprinting into the frontlines! If supported, this enemy can cause a lot of trouble due to its deadly range attacks.

==Strategy==
Heavy Assault C.A.T. is outranged by [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]], so you can spam plenty of meatshields to protect the both of them.

